        "TileImage": "$($repository 415319ba-b510-49e4-9bcc-be6d678afe7f).Image",
        "Description": "Deep below the rain-slicked alleys of Chongqing, a sinister alliance has flourished. Dr. Donnie Demiraca, a disgraced pharmacologist hiding behind the façade of a private clinic, has partnered with biotech executives Yingtai Tang and Xiaoqing Feng. Together, they’ve been conducting illegal neurological experiments on vulnerable test subjects promising miracle cures, but leaving them a husk of what they were.\r\rYour contract: Kill all three, ensuring their ends appear to be unfortunate accidents.",
